2631_5457320628217598909_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1XB4cVBPX6MQ7kNvwGjS0xW&_nc_oc=AdpgNW8BV9sooCwMNEbN0LTUYC9l4fo1p73Bpz93cSrWt-fd9QWW5vSW-SXc31WQCoc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQWq9mrhRnZ9kl3J9Cm06_KKZtk5v_lCWNzlGf3zSAYgQ&oe=6AE73F4F"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1849839542992739", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_1849839546326072_4035769355140820369_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XfKqgaElJe8Q7kNvwFPOewE&_nc_oc=Adr1p2XJnrHcCbtyb7OoaCsPj_0tYG_cTgb3XeBuQCk3Azr7Ih-A4znl9lmI_d2_iww&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSn2q4O2YSe6BDdmZ46n8wdDC24bVdThBk_Ka2_M8hLyA&oe=6AE73DCD"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1767244957967222", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/585819904_1767244961300555_7554718931845842271_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NmXfckmHfx0Q7kNvwFBc9-4&_nc_oc=Adqgj_ffIBrfPUTwZqSvYi633ni8JSDEaiw5MLLoQWOu-Grtn9o99T6xvqG_F228R80&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQn_LBTs7j1zkPcEZtndsuK2x0mdLX5DUEtGB-IuhYlQw&oe=6AE764EB"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1189718949948137", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823802_1189718953281470_378474496700656237_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iCfUOuE5fi8Q7kNvwEMcaiL&_nc_oc=AdrMVnKxb1Z04BV_kZgVE45zHXFhX-TSVykTZMo-APR45yZDxwr8HK9RYlmHfWvdXX8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSG6WWJBbrAQddaZUqEw2wJhF4_2qq__iexJn_d1tauPg&oe=6AE749F1"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1705557430462317", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823351_1705557437128983_2892223783731412237_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HeEIUA455bwQ7kNvwFmkaK-&_nc_oc=Adrw4w3EuxGL8zX7djeH6DAeGmlYJoXT2ZYFac4EEWeNEaoBRn9fEyKq9168MPyfJS4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQi54QCMNcqh44tGx3G3BaS68noT87qRxbqkgwbDcsHYw&oe=6AE76DC5"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Feather Dodge", "keywords": ["dodge", "birds", "angry", "fly", "horizon"], "long_description": "Take Flight and Dodge the Flock in the Ultimate VR Reflex Challenge!\n\nSpread your wings and prepare for a high-speed airborne adventure in Feather Dodge! In this vibrant, fast-paced VR arcade experience, you control a swift little bird soaring through a dense, beautiful pine forest. Your mission is simple but intense: survive the incoming rush of eccentric, colorful birds flying straight your way!\n\nThe sky gets crowded quickly as a massive variety of round, stylized feathered rivals zoom past. Use your VR controllers to seamlessly weave left, right, up, and down to avoid sudden mid-air collisions. As the timer ticks up, the speed increases and the patterns become trickier, pushing your hand-eye coordination and spatial awareness to the absolute limit.\n\nHow long can you rule the forest canopy before the chaos catches up to you?\n\nKey Features:\nIntuitive VR Controls: Seamlessly guide your bird's flight path using your VR controllers for sharp, precise, and responsive dodging mechanics.\n\nFast-Paced Arcade Thrills: Experience a continuous wave of unpredictable incoming traffic that tests your reaction speed with every second.\n\nVibrant Stylized Visuals: Fly through a beautifully animated 3D forest environment filled with lush greenery, towering trees, and a colorful cast of expressive avian characters.\n\nDynamic High-Score Tracking: Watch your survival time climb in real-time, push past your limits, and try to break your personal record on every run.", "short_description": "Take flight and test your reflexes! Navigate a swift bird through a dense, endless forest, dodging incoming waves of colorful feathered rivals in this fast-paced VR arcade challenge."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nomanawan89.wixsite.com/brokenengineers", "deve